(footprint "ProtoSupplies_PSB-1" (version 20241229) (generator "pcbnew") (generator_version "9.0") (layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "ProtoSupplies PSB-1 MCU proto board with DC input: 102 x 102 mm FR-4, 3.5 mm holes on a 91.44 mm square, 2.54 mm grid of 1.02 mm plated holes with 1.78 mm pads. Pads are named by net: H1-H40 (2x20 header and its breakout pads), K1-K20 (staggered 2x10 header), G (all ground columns, the ground band and the DC input ground), V1-V7 (the seven V bus columns left to right, each with the feed pad in the V band), VIN (DC input, 2x2 jumper bottom row and the VIN column), LED (R1-LED node), a<row>..f<row> (3- or 6-hole strips, rows numbered 1-38 from the top). Copper lines reproduce the bus traces for the 3D view only; connectivity in a design still needs tracks. Geometry from the vendor dimension drawing and CAD renders; DC input part positions +/-0.15 mm.")
	(tags "protosupplies psb-1 protoboard proto board")
